{"version":1,"content":"<html><body>\n<p>ViuTV配對綜藝節目《直樂VIURIETY The Choose Day 2.0》於11月10日迎來最終表白日，多位參賽者之間錯綜複雜感情線推向極致。原本大熱配對組合突然生變，女方當面劃清界線堅拒成為男方感情退路。這場充滿計算與真心的愛情角力最終誕生出令人跌破眼鏡震撼結局。</p>\n<h2>《直樂VIURIETY》表白日爆發激烈衝突</h2>\n<p>節目去到最後階段，各人互動變得極具火藥味與戲劇性。Kenneth與丁丁之間產生強烈化學反應，女方更公開坦承對方是全場最令她感興趣參賽者，瞬間推高現場曖昧氣氛。另一邊廂，翊行因為早前發動過於猛烈攻勢，反而令心儀對象宇夫承受巨大心理壓力而選擇退縮逃避，翊行試圖力挽狂瀾相約對方觀看日出，令現場氣氛變得相當緊繃。</p>\n<h2>Angel狠拒Howard拒絕擔當安全牌</h2>\n<p>處於多角關係漩渦中心的Howard陷入嚴重選擇困難，同時對當初心動對象宇夫及日久生情對象Angel產生好感。面對男方搖擺不定，Angel毫不猶豫作出強硬反擊，直接向對方攤牌表達立場：「如果我唔係你嘅第一選擇，咁你之後唔好再揀我，因為我嚟呢個節目唔係做人哋嘅安全牌！」這番斬釘截鐵言論瞬間將兩人關係推向冰點。</p>\n<h2>回顧Howard越野車浪漫約會倍添無奈</h2>\n<p>早於11月3日播出一集，Howard與Angel感情一度極速升溫，雙方共同參與刺激越野車約會。當時男方表現得極為主動進擊，更出言試探：「如果快嘅時候我係咪可以攬住你？」隨後順勢擁抱女方，兩人甜蜜互動一度獲全場看好。然而這份短暫甜蜜最終敵不過男方三心兩意，令這段原本備受期待感情線迎來極大反差。</p>\n<h2>網民熱議《直樂VIURIETY》最終配對</h2>\n<p>節目走向引發各大社交平台激烈討論，大批觀眾對女方果斷斬纜舉動拍手叫好。有網民留言大讚：「Angel簡直係人間清醒，絕對唔可以委屈自己做後備！」同時亦有部分聲音對男方優柔寡斷表現感到不滿，直指其貪心心態最終只會兩頭不到岸。公眾紛紛聚焦於最終表白成功幸運兒身份，對這場愛情修羅場最終賽果充滿無限想像。</p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179430814646330157_4851712536af2f8338141c.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"丁丁更指Kenneth是節目中令她最感興趣的參賽者，一眾參賽者都忍不住起哄！.jpg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179430814646330157_4851712536af2f8338141c.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>丁丁更指Kenneth是節目中令她最感興趣的參賽者，一眾參賽者都忍不住起哄！（圖片來源：ViuTV）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179430814943236725_7830145406af2f8362680f.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"節目參賽者 Chuck 與 Muji.jpg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179430814943236725_7830145406af2f8362680f.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>節目參賽者 Chuck 與 Muji（圖片來源：ViuTV）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179430815251929542_19618572186af2f8393b925.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Angel之後更對Howard說：「如果我唔係你嘅第一選擇，咁你之後唔好再揀我，因為我嚟呢個節目唔係做人哋嘅安全牌！」.jpg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179430815251929542_19618572186af2f8393b925.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>Angel之後更對Howard說：「如果我唔係你嘅第一選擇，咁你之後唔好再揀我，因為我嚟呢個節目唔係做人哋嘅安全牌！」（圖片來源：ViuTV）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179430815577422686_6442848826af2f83c2fac1.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Howard最終於越野車與Angel約會，二人都對這類刺激活動感到超興奮。_.jpg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179430815577422686_6442848826af2f83c2fac1.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>Howard最終於越野車與Angel約會，二人都對這類刺激活動感到超興奮。（圖片來源：ViuTV）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179430815813731277_12260405056af2f83e815ae.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"眾參賽者在最終表白日前舉行聚餐。.jpg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179430815813731277_12260405056af2f83e815ae.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>眾參賽者在最終表白日前舉行聚餐。（圖片來源：ViuTV）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/17943081598798423_17018157326af2f8403f395.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"節目參賽者 Howard.jpg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/17943081598798423_17018157326af2f8403f395.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>節目參賽者 Howard（圖片來源：ViuTV）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179430816210344421_18860358486af2f8428ed86.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"節目參賽者 丁丁.jpg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179430816210344421_18860358486af2f8428ed86.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>節目參賽者 丁丁（圖片來源：ViuTV）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179430816422094294_3345112026af2f844acbae.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"節目參賽者 宇夫.jpg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179430816422094294_3345112026af2f844acbae.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>節目參賽者 宇夫（圖片來源：ViuTV）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/17943081659648547_1958632026af2f8466622c.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"節目參賽者 翊行.jpg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/17943081659648547_1958632026af2f8466622c.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>節目參賽者 翊行（圖片來源：ViuTV）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179430816802595376_16934117236af2f8487a3d8.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"節目參賽者 Angel.jpg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179430816802595376_16934117236af2f8487a3d8.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>節目參賽者 Angel（圖片來源：ViuTV）</figcaption></figure>\n<p>\n</p>\n<p>將來還有什麼演唱會值得留意？<i></i></p>\n<p>有不少歌手宣布舉辦演唱會，小編為你整合了<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/entertainment/hong-kong-concerts-2025-2402813/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">香港演唱會2025一覽</a></b>，包含各演唱會優先購票日期、公開售票日期、門票價錢、座位表等，想搶飛粉絲必定要留意！</p>\n<p>香港有甚麼週末好去處推介？<i></i></p>\n<p>香港18區都非常值得花時間好好探索，一家大細去暢玩的<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1217277/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1217277\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">親子好去處</a></b>、拍拖推介32大<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1312748/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1312748\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">情侶好去處</a></b>、落雨必去的<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1128512/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1128512\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">室內好去處</a></b>、慶生推薦20大<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1363483/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1363483\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">生日好去處</a></b>、新手必備19大靚景<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1244714/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1244714\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">行山好去處</a></b>、秋天戶外<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1257443/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1257443\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">露營好去處</a></b>…..</p>\n</body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-10T12:20:22.668884+00:00","quality":{"score":3,"chars":1385,"images":10,"source":"WeekendHK","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-10T12:00:10+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-10T13:26:05.639544+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-10T12:13:51.033276+00:00","content_hash":"47a2ca17bc54cb6205af62697cabd98bab13ee3b9061315c6b5f493776b6db8a","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}